  "title": "Chart card",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 1.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The frame every dashboard chart sits in: the question as its title, what is measured under it, then optional actions (a range control, a menu), the headline figure with its change, the chart, and a footer with the source time or a link to the full report.",
    "id": "Bingkai untuk setiap grafik di dasbor: pertanyaan sebagai judul, apa yang diukur di bawahnya, lalu aksi opsional (kontrol periode, menu), angka utama beserta perubahannya, grafik, dan footer berisi waktu data atau tautan ke laporan lengkap."
  },
  "titleId": "Chart card",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Period control, menu, figure and footer",
        "desc": "Switch the period: the stacked areas move from where they are to the new data, the scale eases to its new range. Point at the plot (or focus it and use the arrow keys) for the day, each channel and the total. Click a legend item to hide a channel. Narrow the window: the period control takes its own row.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cc-orders-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\">\n    <div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cc-orders-q\">How do residents apply for business permits?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Applications per day, website and counter</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\">\n      <div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Period\" data-lds-segmented data-lds-chart-for=\"cc-orders\">\n        <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"7d\">7 days</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-set=\"30d\">30 days</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"90d\">3 months</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n        <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"More actions for Permit applications chart\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"cc-orders-menu\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n        <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"cc-orders-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Permit applications chart\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n          <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Download CSV</button>\n          <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span>Copy link to chart</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card__figure\"><div class=\"chart-card__big\" data-chart-figure>2,545</div><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\" data-chart-delta><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>7%</span><span class=\"chart-card__sub\" data-chart-note>against the 30 days before</span></div>\n  <div cl