      {
        "title": "A dashboard row",
        "desc": "Two cards share one grid. The bar chart highlights the answer; the line chart compares this year with last year, dashed.",
        "html": "<div class=\"auto-grid\" style=\"--min: 300px;\">\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cc-busy\">\n    <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cc-busy\">Which day is the puskesmas busiest?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Patient visits per weekday, this week</div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Puskesmas visits per weekday this week. Thursday is busiest with 31 visits.\",\"x\":[\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\",\"Sat\",\"Sun\"],\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Visits\",\"values\":[18,24,22,31,27,12,6],\"kind\":\"bar\"}],\"highlight\":3,\"height\":180}'></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cc-score\">\n    <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cc-score\">Is resident satisfaction improving?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Average survey score per week, out of 100</div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Average service satisfaction score per week. This year rose from 64 to 81; last year stayed near 70.\",\"x\":[\"W1\",\"W2\",\"W3\",\"W4\",\"W5\",\"W6\",\"W7\",\"W8\"],\"kind\":\"line\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"This year\",\"values\":[64,67,66,71,74,73,78,81]},{\"name\":\"Last year\",\"values\":[68,70,69,71,70,72,71,70],\"dashed\":true,\"color\":4}],\"y\":{\"min\":50,\"max\":90},\"height\":180}'></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__foot\"><span>Example data</span><a class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm\" href=\"#cc-score\">See every survey<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a></div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kontrol periode, menu, angka, dan footer",
        "desc": "Ganti periodenya: area bertumpuk bergerak dari posisinya sekarang ke data baru, skala berpindah halus ke rentang barunya. Arahkan kursor ke plot (atau fokuskan lalu pakai tombol panah) untuk melihat hari, tiap saluran, dan totalnya. Klik item legenda untuk menyembunyikan satu saluran. Persempit jendela: kontrol periode pindah ke barisnya sendiri.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cc-orders-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\">\n    <div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cc-orders-q\">Lewat mana warga mengajukan izin usaha?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Permohonan per hari, situs web dan loket</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\">\n      <div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Periode\" data-lds-segmented data-lds-chart-for=\"cc-orders\">\n        <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"7d\">7 hari</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-set=\"30d\">30 hari</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"90d\">3 bulan</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n        <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Aksi lain untuk Grafik permohonan izin\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"cc-orders-menu\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n        <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"cc-orders-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Grafik permohonan izin\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n          <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Unduh CSV</button>\n          <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span>Salin tautan grafik</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card__figure\"><div class=\"chart-card__big\" data-chart-figure>2.545</div><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\" data-chart-delta><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>7%</span><span class=\"chart-card__sub\" data-chart-note>dibanding 30 hari sebelumnya</span></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\"